    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312430/extras/d34065827c6a2d4b31d915fadc93ca36.avif?t=1754625472\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312430/extras/b7011239fbd28eae76db2124ba9981e2.avif?t=1754625472\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312430/extras/e279e9e505374c1b32b8034d0318073d.avif?t=1754625472\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge in an unknown world as a vulnerable Victim that can't remember their past and doesn't know if they are dreaming a nightmare or if this is the real world.<br><br>A psychological dungeon crawling RPG horror with a premise beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a desolate lonely world and find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lies, psychological personalities and battle inner demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based combat with obscured hardcore mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use a plethora of strange items and abilities.<br><br>-custom built real time-turn based battle system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-7 Large over world areas<br>-16 large dungeons<br>-40 Caves<br>-4 Character Party<br>-item collecting<br>-equip characters with items to learn abilities to use in battle<br>-gather EXP to level up<br>-equip armor and weapons<br>-in depth player stats<br>-choose your way to play through equipment variety and non-linear exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hand drawn enemy monsters that originated on pen and paper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-human made sound design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312430/extras/d34065827c6a2d4b31d915fadc93ca36.avif?t=1754625472\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312430/extras/b7011239fbd28eae76db2124ba9981e2.avif?t=1754625472\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312430/extras/e279e9e505374c1b32b8034d0318073d.avif?t=1754625472\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge in an unknown world as a vulnerable Victim that can't remember their past and doesn't know if they are dreaming a nightmare or if this is the real world.<br><br>A psychological dungeon crawling RPG horror with a premise beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a desolate lonely world and find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lies, psychological personalities and battle inner demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based combat with obscured hardcore mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use a plethora of strange items and abilities.<br><br>-custom built real time-turn based battle system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-7 Large over world areas<br>-16 large dungeons<br>-40 Caves<br>-4 Character Party<br>-item collecting<br>-equip characters with items to learn abilities to use in battle<br>-gather EXP to level up<br>-equip armor and weapons<br>-in depth player stats<br>-choose your way to play through equipment variety and non-linear exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hand drawn enemy monsters that originated on pen and paper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-human made sound design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
